","quote":"太祖以贼恃胜而骄，欲设奇兵，挑击之于寿张。先与信出行战地，后步军未至，而猝与贼遇，遂接战","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":426,"end":470,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-a9a26d6606b2999b852e","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"遣归募兵，得千余人","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":60,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-b03c1ea51513f5f237c7","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-185e400f2a714a9654ae","layer":"original","quote":"灵帝时为骑都尉，大将军何进遣东募兵","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":285,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":53,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-b47d6ab0cc4198f95915","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"汴水之败，信被创，韬在阵战亡","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":257,"end":271,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-c14a70047ab7cfbf9eef","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖为东郡太守，表信为济北相","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":378,"end":392,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-c2fc2ae884accec5804c","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"信乃引军还乡里，收徒众二万，骑七百，辎重五千余乘","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":119,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-c51997feaabc6ad8510a","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"是岁，太祖始起兵于己吾；信与弟韬，以兵应太祖","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":144,"end":166,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-deae771f204885306ffc","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"会黄巾大众入州界，刘岱欲与战，信止之；岱不从，遂败","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":393,"end":418,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-dfeffc3d9e1fb055cbe4","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"时绍众最盛，豪杰多向之。信独谓太祖曰：‘夫略不世出，能总英雄以拨乱反正者，君也。苟非其人，虽强必毙。君殆天之所启！’遂深自结纳，太祖亦亲异焉","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":186,"end":256,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e0a18c76fe8bc6db0142","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"信言于太祖曰：‘奸臣乘衅，荡覆王室；英雄奋节，天下响应者，义也。今绍为盟主，因权专利，将自生乱，是复有一卓也。若抑之，则力不能制，只以遘难，又何能济？且可规大河之南，以待其变。’太祖善之","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":284,"end":377,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-f7f9a2b977ad490cb6a3","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"信殊死战，以救太祖；太祖仅得溃围出，信遂没。时年四十一","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":471,"end":498,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-f9c0a528cd48030ddb9c","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"信至京师，董卓亦始到。信知卓必为乱，劝袁绍袭卓，绍畏卓不敢发","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":81,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-fbfb0c9563b0f1a82abf","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-185e400f2a714a9654ae","layer":"original","quote":"后为济北相，协规太祖，身以遇害","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":285,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":71,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-febc20005694667dc11b","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"大将军何进辟。拜骑都尉","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":48,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o006a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-00c2849f3181fe0a8f0f","layer":"original","quote":"先是，进遣骑都尉泰山鲍信，所在募兵〖9〗。适至，信谓绍曰：“卓拥强兵，有异志；今不早图，将为所制。及其初至疲劳，袭之，可擒也！”绍畏卓，不敢发；信遂还乡里。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o036a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-5c715668eee2a0a99811","layer":"original","quote":"绍遂以勃海起兵，将以诛卓。语在《武纪》。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o006","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-00c2849f3181fe0a8f0f","layer":"original","quote":"先是，进遣骑都尉泰山鲍信，所在募兵〖9〗。适至，信谓绍曰：“卓拥强兵，有异志；今不早图，将为所制。及其初至疲劳，袭之，可擒也！”绍畏卓，不敢发；信遂还乡里。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-ad4f0936fa1d1b30987f","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-05cfa81b113d3f6a0be9","layer":"original","quote":"初平中〖1〗，以众随太祖，破黄巾于寿张","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-8313539e9d272536b98f","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-e0bf87d51bee3453a4e2","layer":"original","quote":"董卓之乱，太祖与邈首举义兵。汴水之战，邈遣卫兹将兵随太祖","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-f64cf1a8c7978e162aed","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c172c36c6f19e1d68402","layer":"pei","quote":"关东义兵起，卓会议大发兵；群僚咸惮卓，莫敢忤旨","attribution":"裴注·张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-011440cf6742ee5cb197","start":246,"end":269,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o008e-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9faaac9907c958c4d4d1","layer":"original","quote":"太祖至陈留〖15〗，散家财，合义兵，将以诛卓。冬十二月，始起兵于己吾〖16〗。﹝四﹞是岁，中平六年也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":121,"end":172,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o009a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-20c7e941eb42ee97df8c","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年春正月〖1〗，后将军袁术、冀州牧韩馥、﹝一﹞豫州刺史孔伷、﹝二﹞兖州刺史刘岱、﹝三﹞河内太守王匡、﹝四﹞勃海太守袁绍、陈留太守张邈、东郡太守桥瑁、﹝五﹞山阳太守袁遗、﹝六﹞济北相鲍信，﹝七﹞同时俱起兵〖2〗。众各数万，推绍为盟主。太祖行奋武将军〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o012a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2ce0778dff9b29b4e2d1","layer":"original","quote":"邈遣将卫兹，分兵随太祖。到荥阳汴水〖9〗，遇卓将徐荣，与战不利，士卒死伤甚多。太祖为流矢所中，所乘马被创〖10〗。从弟洪以马与太祖〖11〗，得夜遁去。荣见太祖所将兵少〖12〗，力战尽日；谓酸枣未易攻也，亦引兵还。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o021b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2d83a73c159b7b6cad48","layer":"original","quote":"刘岱欲击之，鲍信谏曰：“今贼众百万，百姓皆震恐，士卒无斗志，不可敌也。观贼众群辈相随〖5〗，军无辎重〖6〗，唯以抄略为资〖7〗。今不若蓄士众之力，先为固守。彼欲战不得，攻又不能；其势必离散。后选精锐，据其要害，击之可破也。”岱不从，遂与战，果为所杀。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o022a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5505cac06f9494b001a0","layer":"original","quote":"信乃与州吏万潜等至东郡〖8〗，迎太祖领兖州牧。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o022b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5505cac06f9494b001a0","layer":"original","quote":"遂进兵，击黄巾于寿张东〖9〗。信力战，斗死，仅而破之〖10〗。﹝二﹞购求信丧不得〖11〗，众乃刻木如信形状，祭而哭焉。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p037a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-923b3640b464a66c29b2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《世语》曰：“岱既死，陈宫谓太祖曰：‘州今无主，而王命断绝。宫请说州中，明府寻往牧之。资之以收天下，此霸王之业也。’宫说别驾、治中曰：‘今天下分裂而州无主。曹东郡，命世之才也；若迎以牧州，必宁生民。’鲍信等亦谓之然。”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e4a6518d16f574fcb395","start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3863a19b555811d1f415","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：初平三年（公元 192）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2063caf2b642ce9ff2bc","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗初平元年：公元 190 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-93d66253e23c705b336d","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c8312ddce42041c69855","layer":"modern","quote":"〖14〗杀太后及弘农王：董卓杀何太后在中平六年（公元 189），但杀弘农王则在第二年的正月。见《后汉书》卷八《灵帝纪》、卷九《献帝纪》。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-449cc7b499c8a1fee35c","start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o008","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9faaac9907c958c4d4d1","layer":"original","quote":"卓到，废帝为弘农王而立献帝〖7〗，京都大乱。卓表太祖为骁骑校尉〖8〗，欲与计事。太祖乃变易姓名，间行东归〖9〗；﹝二﹞出关〖10〗，过中牟〖11〗。为亭长所疑〖12〗，执诣县。邑中或窃识之〖13〗，为请得解。﹝三﹞卓遂杀太后及弘农王〖14〗。太祖至陈留〖15〗，散家财，合义兵，将以诛卓。冬十二月，始起兵于己吾〖16〗。﹝四﹞是岁，中平六年也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":172,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o009","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-20c7e941eb42ee97df8c","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年春正月〖1〗，后将军袁术、冀州牧韩馥、﹝一﹞豫州刺史孔伷、﹝二﹞兖州刺史刘岱、﹝三﹞河内太守王匡、﹝四﹞勃海太守袁绍、陈留太守张邈、东郡太守桥瑁、﹝五﹞山阳太守袁遗、﹝六﹞济北相鲍信，﹝七﹞同时俱起兵〖2〗。众各数万，推绍为盟主。太祖行奋武将军〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o019","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620706e925cc9a268c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖1〗，太祖军顿丘，毒等攻东武阳。太祖乃引兵西入山，攻毒等本屯〖2〗。﹝一﹞毒闻之，弃武阳还〖3〗。太祖要击眭固〖4〗，又击匈奴于夫罗于内黄〖5〗，皆大破之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o021","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2d83a73c159b7b6cad48","layer":"original","quote":"青州黄巾众百万入兖州〖3〗，杀任城相郑遂，转入东平〖4〗。刘岱欲击之，鲍信谏曰：“今贼众百万，百姓皆震恐，士卒无斗志，不可敌也。观贼众群辈相随〖5〗，军无辎重〖6〗，唯以抄略为资〖7〗。今不若蓄士众之力，先为固守。彼欲战不得，攻又不能；其势必离散。后选精锐，据其要害，击之可破也。”岱不从，遂与战，果为所杀。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":157,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o022","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5505cac06f9494b001a0","layer":"original","quote":"信乃与州吏万潜等至东郡〖8〗，迎太祖领兖州牧。遂进兵，击黄巾于寿张东〖9〗。信力战，斗死，仅而破之〖10〗。﹝二﹞购求信丧不得〖11〗，众乃刻木如信形状，祭而哭焉。追黄巾，至济北〖12〗；乞降。冬，受降卒三十余万，男女百余万口。收其精锐者，号为“青州兵”。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p030","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fab2b2926d4cb6fded1b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝七﹞信事，见子《勋传》。","attribution":"裴松之互见提示","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d70b60fc73db4363dbf6","start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p037","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-923b3640b464a66c29b2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《世语》曰：“岱既死，陈宫谓太祖曰：‘州今无主，而王命断绝。宫请说州中，明府寻往牧之。资之以收天下，此霸王之业也。’宫说别驾、治中曰：‘今天下分裂而州无主。曹东郡，命世之才也；若迎以牧州，必宁生民。’鲍信等亦谓之然。”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e4a6518d16f574fcb395","start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o035a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-879705d364554277c415","layer":"original","quote":"太祖起义兵讨董卓，至荥阳，为卓将徐荣所败。太祖失马，贼追甚急；洪下，以马授太祖；太祖辞让，洪曰：“天下可无洪，不可无君！”遂步从到汴水。水深不得渡，洪循水得船；与太祖俱济，还奔谯。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":166,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o019a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-2ece650b5a67261991f0","layer":"original","quote":"黄巾起，鲍信招合徒众，禁附从焉。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o019","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-2ece650b5a67261991f0","layer":"original","quote":"于禁字文则，泰山钜平人也〖1〗。黄巾起，鲍信招合徒众，禁附从焉。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
